      "title": "Wagga Wagga family members of alleged DV murderer charged with being accessories after the fact",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/09/danielle-madgwick-dv-murder-family-of-accused-charged-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Danielle Madgwick died in regional NSW in September after suffering multiple stab wounds to her upper body</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Family members of a man accused of the domestic violence murder of a 23-year-old woman in south-western New South Wales have been charged with being accessories to the alleged crime.</p><p>Emergency services were called to a Wagga Wagga home on the morning of 19 September where they found Danielle Madgwick suffering multiple stab wounds to her upper body. She died at the scene.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/09/danielle-madgwick-dv-murder-family-of-accused-charged-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
