      "title": "Man charged with murder over fatal stabbing of HungryPanda delivery rider in Melbourne",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/09/man-charged-fatal-stabbing-hungrypanda-delivery-driver-jianming-feng-melbourne-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Footscray man charged over death of 47-year-old Feng Jianming in the CBD on Friday night</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>A man has been charged with murder after a delivery rider was stabbed to death while working, leaving his family bereft and a city in mourning.</p><p>On Friday night, HungryPanda delivery rider Feng Jianming, 47, and another rider confronted a man allegedly tampering with their bikes in Melbourne’s city centre.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/09/man-charged-fatal-stabbing-hungrypanda-delivery-driver-jianming-feng-melbourne-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
